ior margin and 6cm from the posterior margin  Within the  central upper breast bordering the inner and outer quadrants is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x  4 0cm area  containing multiple pink tan  firm nodules  ranging from 0 2cm   up to 1 6cm in greatest dimension  The closest anterior margin is 2 5cm  and  the closest posterior margin is 5 5cm  Approximately 4cm inferior to this  area  additionally within the central breast  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 3 0cm area with  multiple nodules  ranging from 0 3cm to 1 8cm in greatest dimension  The  closest nodule is 6 0cm from the posterior margin and 4 0cm from the anterior  margin  Within the upper outer quadrant  there is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm area of  fibrous tissue  with chalky punctate areas  abutting the anterior and posterior  margins  subjacent to the epidermal scar  Lymph nodes are not identified  within the lateral tissue  Also received in the same container is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE  cm  tan  unremarkable  skin ellipse  excised to a depth of 1 5cm   Representative sections are submitted as follows      REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Epidermal lesions    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Mass  1    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Closest anterior and posterior margins  mass  1    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Mass  2    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Closest anterior and posterior margins  mass  2    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Intervening tissue between mass  1 and mass  2    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Mass  3    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Closest anterior and posterior margins  mass  3    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Intervening tissue between mass  2 and mass  3    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Mass  4    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Closest anterior and posterior margins  mass  4    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Central superior area  to include a representative section from each  nodule  from medial to lateral    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Closest anterior and posterior margins from central area    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Central inferior area  to include a rep